PersianDateTime midnight-safe time + better next-legal banner + Tools moved to bottom tabs

1. PersianDateTime: replaced the native <input type="time"> with two
   compact 24h selects glued together as a single visual pill (.pdt-time
   -split / .pdt-time-cell / .pdt-time-sep). Outer shape matches the
   original .pdt-time so the "3 selects + 1 time block" layout the user
   liked is preserved. 00:00 and 00:30 (and every other 5-min value) are
   now reachable on every browser, and onChange fires immediately on
   each select change — so the ETD → Reporting → Reference auto-update
   in ProposedFlight works reliably even via the time portion.

2. ResultsPanel: rewrote the "نزدیک‌ترین استندبای / پرواز قانونی" banner.
   New fmtJDateLong helper produces weekday + day + full month + year in
   Persian. Banner now has a centered "when" card with the weekday on
   top, big day+month+year row, and time on a separate line. Removed the
   "·" Latin separator and LTR span — fully RTL Persian structure.

3. Moved the FTL "ابزارها" (Toolbox) sub-tab out of FtlTab. It is now a
   top-level bottom tab in BottomTabs (between FTL and Stats). Tools are
   general aviation calculators (WOCL, Acclimatization, Cabin Report,
   IFR Planner) — they are NOT specific to the FTL Checker and belong at
   the app-shell level.
